{"sections":[{"slug":"周炜良定理","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"周炜良定理"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">周炜良定理</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“周炜良定理”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>$\\mathbb P^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的紧复子流形是若干齐次多项式的公共零点集</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/复流形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">复流形</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/代数簇","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数簇</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}